      },
      "message": "fix(xtask): one life rule for the JSON file of a recording build\n\nReview of #3738. The JSON file is next to the step log, opened with\ncreate_new (an entry at the name is not followed), and removed by a guard\non each exit. An I/O error of the file is \"nothing recorded\", not a gate\nerror: the build runs with its JSON dropped and its suites start cargo.\n\nRefs #3675\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
